{
  "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
  "leadInSeconds": 0.0,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "hook",
      "text": "The company spent millions building its platform. But one missing rule exposed its customers.",
      "emotion": "dramatic",
      "rate": "+14%",
      "pitch": "-4Hz",
      "start": 0.25,
      "duration": 5.256,
      "end": 5.506,
      "words": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "business",
      "text": "Imagine a company with thousands of customers, a polished application, and a powerful database holding sensitive business information.",
      "emotion": "curiosity",
      "rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "start": 5.56,
      "duration": 7.752,
      "end": 13.312,
      "words": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "authentication",
      "text": "Users had to log in. But the backend failed to verify whether each user was actually allowed to access the specific record they requested.",
      "emotion": "seriousness",
      "rate": "+14%",
      "pitch": "-3Hz",
      "start": 14.0,
      "duration": 7.68,
      "end": 21.68,
      "words": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "mistake",
      "text": "The mistake was broken access control. A request could reach another customer's data because ownership was never properly checked.",
      "emotion": "concern",
      "rate": "+13%",
      "pitch": "-4Hz",
      "start": 23.0,
      "duration": 7.08,
      "end": 30.08,
      "words": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "exposure",
      "text": "Now imagine invoices, customer records, and confidential business information becoming accessible to someone who should never have seen them.",
      "emotion": "dramatic",
      "rate": "+12%",
      "pitch": "-5Hz",
      "start": 33.0,
      "duration": 7.968,
      "end": 40.968,
      "words": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "impact",
      "text": "The damage goes beyond data. Customer trust, legal exposure, business reputation, and operational continuity can all be at risk.",
      "emotion": "seriousness",
      "rate": "+12%",
      "pitch": "-3Hz",
      "start": 45.0,
      "duration": 8.304,
      "end": 53.304,
      "words": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "solution",
      "text": "The fix begins with security by design: enforce authorization on every sensitive request, deny access by default, use least-privilege database accounts, and test access rules before deployment.",
      "emotion": "confidence",
      "rate": "+12%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "start": 55.0,
      "duration": 11.352,
      "end": 66.352,
      "words": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "takeaway",
      "text": "A beautiful application is not a secure application. Security must be designed into the system, not added after the damage.",
      "emotion": "reflection",
      "rate": "+15%",
      "pitch": "-3Hz",
      "start": 72.5,
      "duration": 7.2,
      "end": 79.7,
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "cta",
      "text": "Would you trust your business data without access controls? Follow for more stories behind the technology.",
      "emotion": "friendly",
      "rate": "+26%",
      "pitch": "-1Hz",
      "start": 79.75,
      "duration": 5.184,
      "end": 84.934,
      "words": 16
    }
  ],
